paragraphs:
“The Word took flesh from Mary and made it His own, thus she is rightly called Theotokos.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/2802.htm
)

“If anyone does not confess that Emmanuel is truly God, and that therefore the holy Virgin is Theotokos, let him be anathema.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/3810.htm
)

“If anyone does not confess the holy Virgin to be Theotokos, he is separated from God.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/3103.htm
)
